      "value": "@{62b61f8ec938a62475e4cd14|full_name} I've done some more testing and I'm not doing anything extra to trigger it. All I'm doing is going prone and not pressing shift while holding W\n\nUsing these 3 worlds, all of which are uploaded using the last 3 sdk version (3.7.1, 3.7.2-beta1, and 3.7.2-beta2)\n\nhttps://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_9d0a759a-172b-4b10-b506-83ff7cb2ea60\n\nhttps://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_56ac0be8-1989-481a-b92f-0b8a37341823\n\nhttps://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_45e52e74-da77-4af2-9e2d-db00e271166c\n\nAll tested with these avatars\n\nhttps://vrchat.com/home/avatar/avtr_ac29e9a5-ab23-41c5-9281-ed5962140f54\n\nhttps://vrchat.com/home/avatar/avtr_05829901-41a5-494c-a004-8ab7a85b1611\n\nUsing the default scene that a new world projects comes with showed that in both beta and live this is present.\n\nWhile in the avatar \"Cube Man with clothes\" I saw that I'm moving but very slowly",
