  "details": "I thought it was just an avatar issue but after switching to live this only happens in the beta.\n\nTo reproduce:\n\n1. Be in desktop mode\n\n2. Go prone\n\n3. Attempt to move around without holding shift\n\nResult: Can't move while prone",
